{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/station_noord.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Station Noord (the city, district 8: Noord): the end of line 52, across the IJ: an island platform under a long canopy between the tracks, the train he came on standing at it; past the gate line the bus station, where the army set up to receive the city: floodlights, tents, trucks in rows. Nobody is there. Modelled after openly licensed photographs; every business name is made up, the landmarks keep theirs. The power is still on; nobody is there. Outdoor (street.py, city.py and landmarks.py build it). Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
